# Active Work Queue

The ordered implementation plan is maintained in
`docs/modernization-roadmap.md`; the production destination is
`docs/architecture/target-architecture.md`.

Work on one logical branch at a time. Do not start a later phase when doing so
would bypass an ownership, contract, correctness or security prerequisite.

- [ ] 1. Architecture/contracts and engineering baseline
- [ ] 2. Java 21 and supported Spring Boot 3.x modernization
- [ ] 3. Catalog consolidation and ownership cleanup
- [ ] 4. Customer Profile, Cognito/OIDC and Cart cleanup
- [ ] 5. Dedicated Inventory and Payment boundaries
- [ ] 6. Order-owned checkout Saga/process manager
- [ ] 7. Transactional Outbox/Inbox with SQS commands and MSK domain facts
- [ ] 8. Search projection, Notification and S3/CloudFront media
- [ ] 9. AWS/EKS, Terraform, GitHub Actions and Argo CD platform
- [ ] 10. Resilience, security, observability, load/failure testing and hardening

For every phase:

- document intended behavior, non-goals, ownership and migration/rollback;
- record material decisions as ADRs without rewriting accepted history;
- add meaningful automated tests, including failure and duplicate paths;
- verify builds and contracts from a clean checkout;
- update operational behavior, telemetry, security and recovery documentation;
- preserve unrelated working-tree changes and do not commit generated output or
  secrets.
